{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13102240","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13102240","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1310224001:1":{"text":"この祭典は、二千年前のカタストロフとの戦いを記念するお祭りです。","source_cn":"大家都知道，祭典源于两千年前与恶魔的战争。<key:d...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD5FD7327AB7AA76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310224002:1":{"text":"あの戦いでは、英雄だけでなく、多くの戦士たちが犠牲になりました。中には名前すら残らなかった者も大勢います……","source_cn":"在那场战争中，除了英雄，还有数不清的战士也献出了生命，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08FA3461726A24CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310224003:1":{"text":"そんな、身を挺して戦った兵士たちに敬意を表して、私たちは雪だるまを作るのです。","source_cn":"所以，我们用亲手堆起来的雪人来向那些在战争中奋不顾身的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67FAE8890425B695","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310224004:1":{"text":"ここにある雪だるまはどれも、最も忠実で、純粋で、勇敢な戦士なのです！","source_cn":"你们堆的每一个雪人，都是最忠诚、最圣洁、最勇敢的战士！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C16D65FBD8B8839","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祭典办事员":{"text":"祭典のスタッフ","source":"祭典办事员","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}